            ]
        )
    ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment ;
    rdfs:comment "Tension: One passage classifies Diagnostic Assessment as a coordinate alternative to Placement, Formative, and Summative assessments. Another passage states that diagnostic assessment is a common form of formative assessment. Both claims are modeled."@en .

